{"seq":1,"slug":"langchain-core","title":"LangChain 核心","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-development/frameworks/langchain-core","wordCount":1300,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"langchain-核心\">LangChain 核心</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>LangChain 的核心设计理念只有两个字：<strong>组合</strong>。它不试图提供一个解决所有问题的大框架，而是提供一组足够小的可复用组件，让你像搭积木一样把它们串起来。理解 LangChain 的关键就是理解这套「积木」是如何统一的。</p>\n<p><strong>统一的基石是 Runnable 协议。</strong> 无论是一个 Prompt、一次模型调用、一段解析逻辑还是一个完整 Agent，只要实现了 Runnable 接口，就能以相同的方式调用（invoke / batch / stream）并被组合。正是这个统一接口，让「管道操作符」式的串联成为可能——你能把任意组件拼成一条链，而不用关心每个组件内部是什么。</p>\n<p><strong>组合的代价是抽象层次变多。</strong> 一条 LCEL 链背后可能藏着一串嵌套的 Runnable，调试时看到的是层层包装而非直白的调用栈。这是组合性框架的固有代价：换来的是灵活与复用，付出的是「出问题时更难看穿」。因此 Callbacks 系统变得格外重要——它是穿透这层抽象、观察链路内部实际行为的主要手段。</p>\n<p><strong>编排能力的演进体现了「无状态 → 有状态」的需求迁移。</strong> 早期的 Chain 与 AgentExecutor 处理的是单次、无状态的流程；当应用需要跨轮次保持状态时，LangGraph 以图模型承担起有状态编排，成为当前构建 Agent 的主线。这条演进线是理解 LangChain 现状的钥匙。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件族</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>在组合中的角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Runnables</td>\n<td>统一调用接口</td>\n<td>所有积木的地基</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prompts/Messages</td>\n<td>构造模型输入</td>\n<td>链的入口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Output Parsers</td>\n<td>解析模型输出</td>\n<td>链的出口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Callbacks</td>\n<td>观测链路内部</td>\n<td>穿透抽象的眼睛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LangGraph</td>\n<td>有状态编排</td>\n<td>从链到图的升级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    LC[&quot;LangChain 生态&quot;] --&gt; Core[&quot;langchain-core&lt;br/&gt;Runnable 抽象&quot;]&#10;    LC --&gt; LS[&quot;LangSmith&lt;br/&gt;可观测性&quot;]&#10;    LC --&gt; LG[&quot;LangGraph&lt;br/&gt;有状态编排&quot;]&#10;    Core --&gt; R[&quot;Runnables&quot;]&#10;    Core --&gt; P[&quot;Prompts&quot;]&#10;    Core --&gt; O[&quot;Output Parsers&quot;]\">graph TD\n    LC[\"LangChain 生态\"] --&gt; Core[\"langchain-core&lt;br/&gt;Runnable 抽象\"]\n    LC --&gt; LS[\"LangSmith&lt;br/&gt;可观测性\"]\n    LC --&gt; LG[\"LangGraph&lt;br/&gt;有状态编排\"]\n    Core --&gt; R[\"Runnables\"]\n    Core --&gt; P[\"Prompts\"]\n    Core --&gt; O[\"Output Parsers\"]</pre><h2 id=\"langchain-架构概览\">LangChain 架构概览</h2><p>LangChain 是目前最流行的 LLM 应用开发框架，提供了从基础模型调用到复杂 Agent 编排的完整工具链。其核心设计理念是<strong>组合性</strong>——通过将小的、可复用的组件串联起来构建复杂应用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    LC[&quot;LangChain 生态&quot;] --&gt; Core[&quot;langchain-core&lt;br/&gt;核心抽象&quot;]&#10;    LC --&gt; Community[&quot;langchain-community&lt;br/&gt;第三方集成&quot;]&#10;    LC --&gt; Partners[&quot;合作伙伴包&lt;br/&gt;langchain-openai 等&quot;]&#10;    LC --&gt; LS[&quot;LangSmith&lt;br/&gt;可观测性平台&quot;]&#10;    LC --&gt; LG[&quot;LangGraph&lt;br/&gt;有状态编排&quot;]&#10;    Core --&gt; R[&quot;Runnables&quot;]&#10;    Core --&gt; P[&quot;Prompts&quot;]&#10;    Core --&gt; M[&quot;Messages&quot;]&#10;    Core --&gt; O[&quot;Output Parsers&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    LC[\"LangChain 生态\"] --&gt; Core[\"langchain-core&lt;br/&gt;核心抽象\"]\n    LC --&gt; Community[\"langchain-community&lt;br/&gt;第三方集成\"]\n    LC --&gt; Partners[\"合作伙伴包&lt;br/&gt;langchain-openai 等\"]\n    LC --&gt; LS[\"LangSmith&lt;br/&gt;可观测性平台\"]\n    LC --&gt; LG[\"LangGraph&lt;br/&gt;有状态编排\"]\n    Core --&gt; R[\"Runnables\"]\n    Core --&gt; P[\"Prompts\"]\n    Core --&gt; M[\"Messages\"]\n    Core --&gt; O[\"Output Parsers\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"chains-与-lcel\">Chains 与 LCEL</h2><p>LangChain Expression Language（LCEL）是 LangChain 的核心编程模型。它通过 <code>|</code> 管道操作符将组件串联，形成声明式的数据处理链：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from langchain_openai import ChatOpenAI&#10;from langchain_core.prompts import ChatPromptTemplate&#10;from langchain_core.output_parsers import StrOutputParser&#10;&#10;prompt = ChatPromptTemplate.from_messages([&#10;    (&quot;system&quot;, &quot;你是一个专业的{domain}助手。&quot;),&#10;    (&quot;user&quot;, &quot;{question}&quot;)&#10;])&#10;&#10;model = ChatOpenAI(model=&quot;gpt-5.6-terra&quot;)&#10;parser = StrOutputParser()&#10;&#10;chain = prompt | model | parser&#10;&#10;result = chain.invoke({&#10;    &quot;domain&quot;: &quot;Python 编程&quot;,&#10;    &quot;question&quot;: &quot;如何实现一个二叉搜索树？&quot;&#10;})&#10;print(result)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> langchain_openai </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ChatOpenAI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> langchain_core.prompts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ChatPromptTemplate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> langchain_core.output_parsers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StrOutputParser</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prompt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ChatPromptTemplate.from_messages([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"system\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"你是一个专业的</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{domain}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">助手。\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{question}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ChatOpenAI(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gpt-5.6-terra\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">parser </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StrOutputParser()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">chain </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prompt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parser</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chain.invoke({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"domain\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Python 编程\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"question\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"如何实现一个二叉搜索树？\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>LCEL 的核心优势在于统一的接口——每个组件都实现了 Runnable 协议：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>使用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>invoke()</code></td>\n<td>同步调用，输入一个值</td>\n<td>单次请求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ainvoke()</code></td>\n<td>异步调用</td>\n<td>高并发场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>batch()</code></td>\n<td>批量调用</td>\n<td>批处理任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>stream()</code></td>\n<td>流式输出</td>\n<td>实时响应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>astream_events()</code></td>\n<td>异步流式事件</td>\n<td>复杂链路追踪</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"results = chain.batch([&#10;    {&quot;domain&quot;: &quot;数据分析&quot;, &quot;question&quot;: &quot;什么是 pandas DataFrame？&quot;},&#10;    {&quot;domain&quot;: &quot;Web 开发&quot;, &quot;question&quot;: &quot;什么是 REST API？&quot;},&#10;    {&quot;domain&quot;: &quot;机器学习&quot;, &quot;question&quot;: &quot;什么是梯度下降？&quot;}&#10;])&#10;&#10;async for chunk in chain.astream({&quot;domain&quot;: &quot;AI&quot;, &quot;question&quot;: &quot;什么是 Agent？&quot;}):&#10;    print(chunk, end=&quot;&quot;, flush=True)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chain.batch([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"domain\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"数据分析\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"question\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"什么是 pandas DataFrame？\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"domain\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Web 开发\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"question\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"什么是 REST API？\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"domain\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"机器学习\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"question\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"什么是梯度下降？\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chunk </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chain.astream({</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"domain\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"AI\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"question\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"什么是 Agent？\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(chunk, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">end</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">flush</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"runnables-组合\">Runnables 组合</h2><p>LCEL 提供了丰富的组合原语，支持顺序、并行、条件等多种编排模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from langchain_core.runnables import RunnableParallel, RunnablePassthrough, RunnableLambda&#10;&#10;parallel_chain = RunnableParallel(&#10;    summary=prompt_summary | model | parser,&#10;    keywords=prompt_keywords | model | parser,&#10;    sentiment=prompt_sentiment | model | parser&#10;)&#10;&#10;result = parallel_chain.invoke({&quot;text&quot;: &quot;LangChain 是一个强大的 LLM 框架...&quot;})&#10;&#10;chain_with_context = RunnableParallel(&#10;    context=retriever,&#10;    question=RunnablePassthrough()&#10;) | prompt | model | parser&#10;&#10;def route(input_data):&#10;    if &quot;code&quot; in input_data[&quot;question&quot;].lower():&#10;        return code_chain&#10;    return general_chain&#10;&#10;routed_chain = RunnableLambda(route)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> langchain_core.runnables </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> RunnableParallel, RunnablePassthrough, RunnableLambda</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">parallel_chain </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> RunnableParallel(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    summary</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prompt_summary </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model </span><span style=\"color: