lculate], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">verbose</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> executor.invoke({</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"input\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Python 3.12 发布于哪年？距今多少年？\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"chat_history\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: []})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"output\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> LangChain 团队推荐使用 LangGraph 来构建更复杂的 Agent 工作流。AgentExecutor 适合简单的 ReAct 循环，而 LangGraph 提供了更精细的状态管理和流程控制。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"langgraph-有状态编排的主线\">LangGraph：有状态编排的主线</h2><p>需要明确的是，LangChain 生态的重心已经迁移。截至 2026 年初，LangChain 与 LangGraph 均已进入 1.x 版本；官方将 LangGraph 定位为构建可控 Agent 的推荐基座，由 LangGraph 驱动的 <code>create_agent</code> 取代 AgentExecutor 成为一等入口。把 LangGraph 仅当作脚注来学习，会错过 LangChain 生态中最重要的工程抽象。</p>\n<p>LangGraph 的编程模型是<strong>图</strong>：状态（State）沿着节点（Node）流动，边（Edge）决定下一步走向，条件边实现分支与循环。这与 LCEL 的线性管道形成互补——管道适合无状态的变换链，图适合带循环、分支和人工介入的 Agent 工作流：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from langchain_openai import ChatOpenAI&#10;from langgraph.graph import StateGraph, MessagesState, START, END&#10;from langgraph.checkpoint.memory import MemorySaver&#10;&#10;llm = ChatOpenAI(model=&quot;gpt-5.6-terra&quot;)&#10;&#10;def call_model(state: MessagesState):&#10;    # 节点读取当前状态，返回对状态的增量更新&#10;    return {&quot;messages&quot;: [llm.invoke(state[&quot;messages&quot;])]}&#10;&#10;builder = StateGraph(MessagesState)&#10;builder.add_node(&quot;model&quot;, call_model)&#10;builder.add_edge(START, &quot;model&quot;)&#10;builder.add_edge(&quot;model&quot;, END)&#10;&#10;# Checkpointer 让图具备持久化记忆：同一 thread_id 的多次调用共享会话状态&#10;agent = builder.compile(checkpointer=MemorySaver())&#10;&#10;config = {&quot;configurable&quot;: {&quot;thread_id&quot;: &quot;session-42&quot;}}&#10;result = agent.invoke(&#10;    {&quot;messages&quot;: [(&quot;user&quot;, &quot;记住：我偏好简洁的回答。&quot;)]},&#10;    config,&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> langchain_openai </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ChatOpenAI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> langgraph.graph </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StateGraph, MessagesState, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">START</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">END</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> langgraph.checkpoint.memory </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MemorySaver</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">llm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ChatOpenAI(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gpt-5.6-terra\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> call_model</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(state: MessagesState):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 节点读取当前状态，返回对状态的增量更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"messages\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [llm.invoke(state[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"messages\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])]}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">builder </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StateGraph(MessagesState)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">builder.add_node(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"model\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, call_model)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">builder.add_edge(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">START</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"model\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">builder.add_edge(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"model\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Checkpointer 让图具备持久化记忆：同一 thread_id 的多次调用共享会话状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">agent </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> builder.compile(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">checkpointer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">MemorySaver())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"configurable\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"thread_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"session-42\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> agent.invoke(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"messages\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"记住：我偏好简洁的回答。\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)]},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    config,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个设计要点值得展开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>与传统循环的差异</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>State</td>\n<td>显式声明的共享状态，节点返回增量更新</td>\n<td>状态可检查、可回放，而非散落在闭包里</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>条件边</td>\n<td>根据状态动态路由到不同节点</td>\n<td>分支/循环是一等公民，无需手写 while</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Checkpointer</td>\n<td>每步落盘状态快照</td>\n<td>天然支持暂停恢复、时间旅行调试</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这套模型直接解决了长任务的状态管理问题——Checkpoint 机制让断点续跑和人工审批成为框架内建能力，而不是自建的状态机代码；本手册第五章「对话状态管理」中的检查点思想正是它的通用化。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>LangChain 以组合性为核心设计理念，通过 LCEL 管道操作符串联组件构建应用。</li>\n<li>Runnable 协议统一了所有组件的接口，支持 invoke、batch、stream 等多种调用方式。</li>\n<li>RunnableParallel、RunnablePassthrough 等原语支持并行、路由等复杂编排。</li>\n<li>Callbacks 系统提供了链路级别的监控、日志和追踪能力。</li>\n<li>AgentExecutor 实现了基础的 ReAct 循环；LangGraph（现已 1.x）以图模型承担有状态编排，是当前构建 Agent 的推荐主线。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LangChain 核心","id":"langchain-核心"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"LangChain 架构概览","id":"langchain-架构概览"},{"level":2,"text":"Chains 与 LCEL","id":"chains-与-lcel"},{"level":2,"text":"Runnables 组合","id":"runnables-组合"},{"level":2,"text":"Callbacks 系统","id":"callbacks-系统"},{"level":2,"text":"Agent Executors","id":"agent-executors"},{"level":2,"text":"LangGraph：有状态编排的主线","id":"langgraph-有状态编排的主线"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"错误恢复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-development/orchestration/error-recovery"},"next":{"title":"LlamaIndex 索引框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-development/frameworks/llamaindex"}}